[output] mixing_depth (m; 0 = off) writes daily averages of CATKE's tracer diffusivity κᶜ and turbulent kinetic energy
e over the top mixing_depth metres to arctic_mixing.jld2. analysis/mixing_timeseries.jl plots region means (the
regions of salinity_drift.jl) against depth and time and tabulates κᶜ at 5, 10, 20 and 40 m per third of the run:
mixing all month points to shear, mixing that grows as the surface cools to convection.

config_sep2005_30d_catke_ice_tanh_mixing.toml: the tanh under-ice run with mixing_depth = 60, to see what still mixes
the Central Arctic (issue #48).

